    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Spirit Conclave",
    "summary": "When an enemy unit destroys an **ASURYANI PSYKER** model of yours, the enemy unit receives a Vengeful Dead token. Attacks by your **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** models against a unit holding any Vengeful Dead tokens get +1 to Hit and +1 to Wound.\n\n**ASURYANI PSYKER** models in your army have **Spirit Guides (Aura)**: a **WRAITHBLADES**, **WRAITHGUARD** or **WRAITHLORD** unit of yours within 12\" of such a model has [Battle Focus](vsdata:ability/aeldari.battle-focus).",
